{title: The Righteous Shall Live}
{subtitle: Habakkuk 1:2–4; 1:5–11; 2:2–4; Romans 1:17; Galatians 3:11; Habakkuk 3:17–19}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
